OL,3,AFive minutes to steal a Renoir: Why
OL,4,Amuseum thefts are becoming bolder
OL,5,Aacross Europe
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen thieves broke into a French museum
OL,8,Fearlier this week and stole four
OL,9,Fpaintings by the impressionist artist
OL,10,FPierre-Auguste Renoir, worth millions
OL,11,Fof euros, not everyone was surprised.
OL,13,FJust last month, the European policing
OL,14,Fagency (Europol) had warned that museum
OL,15,Fthefts across Europe were growing
OL,16,Fincreasingly brazen.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
