OL,3,AGrammy-winning US rapper Lil Durk
OL,4,Aacquitted in murder-for-hire trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FLil Durk has had seven albums in the US
OL,7,FBillboard chart's top five since 2019
OL,8,Fand has also collaborated with stars
OL,9,Fincluding Drake and J Cole on hit
OL,10,Fsingles.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
